  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 4.54,
      "e": 7.38,
      "text": "(uplifting music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.99,
      "e": 23.28,
      "text": "- Today we are bringing the Beaumont residents"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.28,
      "e": 26.44,
      "text": "back in from both San Antonio and Dallas"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.44,
      "e": 27.51,
      "text": "and some other places,"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.51,
      "e": 29.97,
      "text": "but specifically those two places."
    },
    {
      "s": 29.97,
      "e": 32.27,
      "text": "They've been in shelter there for several days"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.27,
      "e": 35.77,
      "text": "and we will put them on buses today by zip code"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.77,
      "e": 37.4,
      "text": "and they will go by their homes."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.4,
      "e": 39.53,
      "text": "And we will try to make an assessment"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.53,
      "e": 40.97,
      "text": "whether they're livable or not."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.97,
      "e": 42.8,
      "text": "And if they are, they'll go back home."
    },
    {
      "s": 42.8,
      "e": 45.59,
      "text": "If they're not, we will take them to a shelter"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.59,
      "e": 47.28,
      "text": "that we've set up here in the city of Beaumont"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.28,
      "e": 50.32,
      "text": "at our Sterling Pruitt Center, which is on Gulf Street."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.32,
      "e": 52.53,
      "text": "And we will take care of those residents"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.53,
      "e": 56.19,
      "text": "and give them room and board until we find out from FEMA"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.19,
      "e": 58.58,
      "text": "what kind of temporary housing will be coming in"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.58,
      "e": 61.26,
      "text": "for those who cannot go back to their homes."
    },
    {
      "s": 61.26,
      "e": 64.25,
      "text": "So, we could not have done this operation today"
    },
    {
      "s": 64.25,
      "e": 66.59,
      "text": "without the National Guard and all the military"
    },
    {
      "s": 66.59,
      "e": 70.59,
      "text": "that's helped us throughout this great challenge"
    },
    {
      "s": 70.69,
      "e": 72.01,
      "text": "in the city of Beaumont."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.01,
      "e": 75.42,
      "text": "And I'd just like to say thank you so much for your service."
    },
    {
      "s": 75.42,
      "e": 76.94,
      "text": "Thank you for what you do for our country,"
    },
    {
      "s": 76.94,
      "e": 78.92,
      "text": "but especially what you've done for Beaumont"
    },
    {
      "s": 78.92,
      "e": 80.92,
      "text": "in these last two weeks."
    },
    {
      "s": 86.17,
      "e": 87.83,
      "text": "- We're here to support our community."
    },
    {
      "s": 87.83,
      "e": 90.66,
      "text": "We wanted to welcome home evacuees back to Beaumont."
    },
    {
      "s": 90.66,
      "e": 91.76,
      "text": "We're coming together as one"
    },
    {
      "s": 91.76,
      "e": 93.89,
      "text": "with the soldiers, the fire department,"
    },
    {
      "s": 93.89,
      "e": 97.66,
      "text": "and serving one purpose, to welcome them back."
    },
    {
      "s": 97.66,
      "e": 99.7,
      "text": "- Yeah, bring them home safe."
    },
    {
      "s": 99.7,
      "e": 101.24,
      "text": "- Everyone has been affected by the storm"
    },
    {
      "s": 101.24,
      "e": 103.49,
      "text": "and we're here to pull together."
    },
    {
      "s": 103.49,
      "e": 106.07,
      "text": "(upbeat music)"
    }
  ],
